strings.VOR_Rus_leader_category_desc:
Most likely, foreign observers and journalists considered this faction to be another offshoot of the Secretarial faction, which is only a tool in Blokhin`s hands for unhindered management of the country. However, this structure shouldn`t be judged by its wrapper. The Party faction acts as a united front of “realist politics”, paying attention to socio-economic and cultural problems in the new state. In realities, if this faction really was a “tool” in the hands of the regime, then this country would not tolerate Russian coexistence with other national minorities, and red terror would become a common everyday phenomenon in Russia.
{vor_powerstruggle_merkulov}

The most numerous in our country is the Secretarial faction, correspondingly the most influential, which manages almost all the main mechanisms of state administration. Although this, in turn, is her curse, as her strength rests on the vitality and activity of the undisputed leader - Vasily Blokhin. Balancing between the dictatorial nature and totalitarian rule of its leader, and the interests of other classes and the army, we can forever hold primacy in domestic politics. It`s important to prevent the strengthening of any other faction in order to preserve the balance of power and counterweights in our Motherland!.
{vor_powerstruggle_blokhin}

Among the opponents of the regime, who do not express their views openly, even with each other, there is an Apolitical faction. Even cooperating with the authorities, they act pragmatically, pursuing useful goals (accepting bribes, obtaining political positions, etc.). Led by the admiral of the Northern Fleet, Arseniy Golovko, these representatives, among whom are many sailors, are forced to live in conditions where there is no non-socialist opposition, but only under the control of the regime. Not tomorrow, not the day after tomorrow, but Secretary Blokhin will definitely die, and only then will they be able to truly declare themselves!
{vor_powerstruggle_golovko}
